      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNestled in one of South Dublin's most prestigious coastal settings, this exceptional four-bedroom detached residence enjoys an enviable position within Glenalua Heights, Killiney, perched beside the iconic Obelisk on Killiney Hill. The property benefits from breathtaking views across the sea and the surrounding landscape of Killiney Hill, offering a unique combination of privacy, natural beauty, and convenience. Rarely does a home come to the market in such a remarkable location, where scenic walks, stunning vistas, and a tranquil atmosphere are all on the doorstep.\n\nThe accommodation extends to generously proportioned living and bedroom spaces, perfectly suited to modern family living. A particular feature of the property is the substantial gardens to the side, over which the property enjoys sole and exclusive use, providing an abundance of outdoor space for relaxation, entertaining, or further landscaping opportunities. The mature setting enhances the sense of seclusion while still being within easy reach of local amenities. The attached garage offers excellent storage and presents exciting potential for conversion, subject to the necessary planning permissions, creating additional living accommodation, a home office, gym, or guest suite.\n\nKilliney is renowned as one of Dublin's most sought-after residential locations, celebrated for its spectacular coastline, scenic hill walks, and vibrant community. The charming village of Dalkey, with its excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, boutiques, and specialist shops, is just a short distance away, while nearby DART services provide swift access to Dublin City Centre. Combining an outstanding location, stunning views, generous gardens, and significant potential, this is a rare opportunity to acquire a distinguished family home in an exceptional setting.\n\nSpecial Features \n\n• Prestigious coastal setting in Glenalua Heights, Killiney, one of South Dublin's most sought-after addresses. \n• Beside the iconic Obelisk on Killiney Hill, offering a landmark-positioned home with unique cachet. \n• Spectacular sea and hill views across Killiney Bay and the surrounding landscape. \n• Exceptional privacy and tranquility with a mature, secluded setting. \n• Detached four-bedroom residence tailored to modern family living. \n• Generously proportioned interiors with well-balanced living and bedroom spaces. \n• Substantial side gardens providing abundant outdoor space. \n• Outstanding potential for landscaping or creating distinct entertaining/relaxation zones. \n• Attached garage with conversion potential (subject to planning) for extra living space, office, gym, or guest suite. \n• Rare market opportunity — homes in this exact location seldom come available. \n• Immediate access to scenic walks on Killiney Hill and along the dramatic coastline. \n• Convenient to Dalkey village, with cafés, restaurants, boutiques, and specialist shops nearby. \n• Excellent connectivity via DART for swift access to Dublin City Centre. \n• Balance of nature and convenience — serene environment within easy reach of amenities. \n• Distinguished family home combining location, views, gardens, and scope to add value."
      },
